0..76 Comment "// A loop hands its endpoint on at its head\'s state, and spends it to leave."
77..79 Comment "//"
80..157 Comment "// A pass that runs again before it finishes a turn of the protocol hands the"
158..237 Comment "// next pass an endpoint at another state. An arm that leaves the loop with the"
238..315 Comment "// endpoint open leaves it otherwise than an arm that runs again. A pass that"
316..378 Comment "// can run again with the endpoint untouched waits on no peer."
379..381 Comment "//"
382..458 Comment "// The checker refuses the first at the `continue` as `TypeMismatch` against"
459..531 Comment "// the head\'s state, and the second at the `offer` as `ArmsDisagree`. It"
532..611 Comment "// refuses the third at the loop as `TypeMismatch`, wanting the `Partial` every"
612..659 Comment "// loop owes that does not follow its protocol."
660..662 Comment "//"
663..714 Comment "// - see: corpus/model/sessions/endpoint-loop.gandr"
716..781 Comment "/// A desk that runs its next pass before it receives the report."
